salman (salman) said Message of the day:  Hello 3dyw players. 
I restored a backup, and the server should be stable. 
Keep in your mind, after some people told me stay up with bgt, and see about the python version later. 
This game will be back, but, will not add any team staff in these days, everything will be works like the old. 
Spams will be taken more seriously, and you can report anyone with /report and your message, please when you report someone, keeps it private to avoid any issues with this player, goodluck... 

Recently, I've been seeing a lot of unnecessary spamming, and random useless strings of text being sent through the chat, I believe that this has gone on long enough, now it's the time where I take the spamming rule in to consideration. 
I won't be asking you too much, I just want you to make the chat clean of any annoyances to make the experience better for everyone. 
In order to make sure this happens, anyone who is caught spamming, be it sending a lot of messages in a short amount of time, or even long strings of meaningless random characters and words will be warned, should they not comply afterwards, other actions would be taken based on how bad the situation is at that time. 
Follow the rules, and I promise you, I'll get along just fine. 
Happy building.

Please for all players, help me by set up your email address in your account, I will use it in the next update soon to reset your password. 
You should use 
/setemail email-address. 
After the next client update, you can reset your account without ask the administrators about this action anymore. 
Keep in your mind, after a while, anyone not set an email address, will mark it as a spam player. 
Thanks for the understanding... 

How to accept the rules: 
So in the first, you should type this command: 
/rules accept
then will works, don't forget the space in the command. 
Be insure first to read the rules with /rules that I mentioned it below. 

If you have any feedback, please use the /feedback command. 
To report a player please use the /report command to send a report to the masters. 

Don't forget to check the game's rules by typing /rules in the chat box, or click alt+slash, and type rules, they are bound to be updated at any time, without any warnings.

this is a 3dyw download link, you can share it with your friends: 
http://hamadqr.com/up/3dyw.zip

And, this is our Discord server, use the link below to join it, and receive notifications about the game.
https://discord.gg/WQyQc2y

The official readme from our website. I will update it when I have a time: 
https://bpearlp.com/projects/3dyw/read-me/

Our 3dyw group in blue pearl production's website: 
https://bpearlp.com/group/3d-yw/

Some important topics, check it to be clear. 
Please, stop with the drama, the insults: 
https://bpearlp.com/groups/3d-yw/forum/topic/please-stop-with-the-drama-the-insults/

How to change the map name to a new name, not really important, but try to understand it please: 
https://bpearlp.com/groups/3d-yw/forum/topic/how-to-change-the-map-name/

Here are a few tips to creating names for your official maps, this will help prevent rejections: 
https://bpearlp.com/groups/3d-yw/forum/topic/tips-about-the-official-maps/

Welcome to 3dyw. 
As you might know, this is a beta game, so if you have any suggestions or bugs worth noting, contact us in the admin tell, or the helper tell that you will find it in the /help command. 

I will contact you as soon as I can. 
Be insure to read the read me file to fully understand how the game is played. Right it's outdated, but can help. 
Also, typing /help in the chat box will give you some useful commands. 
Anything else? Don't worry, the active players, 3dyw's staff, will try to help you as best as they can if they have a time for sure. 
that's all, happy building!
